> accept.mov files but I couldn=E2=80=99t open the ones you sent.
>
>
>
> I did have a reply from the property manager who advised me that they hav=
e
> booked a cleaner to attend the building this week to ensure the area is
> clean and accessible.  The Branch though cannot stop the landlord from
> doing the renovations; only advising them that they must ensure you have
> access to the services until May 1, 2024.   If your items are damaged
> because of the landlord=E2=80=99s negligence (either due to the dust or s=
ecurity)
> then you have the right to file a claim through our Branch for
> compensation.  A hearing would be scheduled at which point a hearing
> officer would make a decision regarding your claim.
>
>
>
> The Branch will be investigating the withdrawal of services for the other
> units but on an individual unit basis.
>
>
>
> Please let me know if you are unable to access the laundry/storage due to
> the drilling so I can follow up with the property manager.
>
>
